invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: the binding's HMAC is keyed by the configuration hash instead of the
  ticket's PSK, so the binding no longer names one ticket: a binding
  copied from another ticket for the same hostname passes. The
  known-answer row and the other-ticket row object.

--- old
    hmac_sha256(psk, psk_len, msg, w.len, out);
--- new
    (void)psk;
    (void)psk_len;
    hmac_sha256(config_hash, SHA256_LEN, msg, w.len, out);
